// g-bootstrap-gate-marker-over-names-each-row-fields: a validated field bound inside an `<each>` row (a per-row USE), the list empty.
<program>
    <row:struct>
        let <v:string="" req/>
        renders <input bind:value=@v/>
    </>
    renders <div><*v/></div>
    <xs:int[free, append]=([])/>
    let <calls:int=0/>
    function register() { @calls = @calls + 1; }
    <main>
        <form id="fm" onsubmit=register()>
            <each in=@xs as x><row/></each>
            <button type="submit">go</button>
        </form>
        <p id="calls">${@calls}</p>
    </main>
</program>
